OL,3,GNEWSASearch for rare sheep roaming wild
OL,4,Anear two towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search is underway for rare sheep
OL,7,Fbelieved to have been dumped and
OL,8,Froaming wild between two towns.
OL,10,FResidents spotted the animals - which
OL,11,Fare thought to be Soay sheep
OL,12,Foriginating from the remote St Kilda
OL,13,Fislands north of Scotland - roaming
OL,14,Fnear Tidworth and Ludgershall in
OL,15,FWiltshire.
OL,17,FFourteen have already been caught over
OL,18,Fthe past several weeks, but Heron's
OL,19,FFarm Animal Rescue in Devizes said
OL,20,Fthere could be up to six still on the
OL,21,Floose.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
