OL,3,GNEWSASearch for rare sheep roaming wild
OL,4,Anear two towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess Scull, from the RSPCA Wiltshire
OL,7,FMid branch, said it was important not
OL,8,Fto approach the sheep, adding: "They
OL,9,Fare strong, they are powerful. The best
OL,10,Fthing you can do is reach out to us."
